 begin="57.226" end="59.755" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.226" end="58.827">就让我爱你爱的很深很远</span><span begin="58.827" end="59.213">很</span><span begin="59.213" end="59.755">古典</span></p></div><div begin="1:00.174" end="1:20.598" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:00.174" end="1:02.697" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.174" end="1:01.443">春水望断</span><span begin="1:01.443" end="1:02.023">夏花宿</span><span begin="1:02.023" end="1:02.697">妆残</span></p><p begin="1:02.707" end="1:05.080" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.707" end="1:03.973">谁问秋蝉</span><span begin="1:03.973" end="1:04.318">谁知</span><span begin="1:04.318" end="1:05.080">冬来</span></p><p begin="1:05.581" end="1:07.934" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.581" end="1:06.555">冷秋千</span><span begin="1:06.555" end="1:07.200">笑声似</span><span begin="1:07.200" end="1:07.934">犹在</span></p><p begin="1:07.944" end="1:10.590" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.944" end="1:08.404">剪不断</span><span begin="1:08.404" end="1:09.136">思念</span><span begin="1:09.136" end="1:09.765">欲理还</span><span begin="1:09.765" end="1:10.590">乱</span></p><p begin="1:10.600" end="1:13.243" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.600" end="1:11.950">前缘等待</span><span begin="1:11.950" end="1:12.353">再续</span><span begin="1:12.353" end="1:13.243">后爱</span></p><p begin="1:13.253" end="1:15.622" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.253" end="1:14.456">梦梅丽娘</span><span begin="1:14.456" end="1:14.875">还魂</span><span begin="1:14.875" end="1:15.622">归来</span></p><p begin="1:15.709" end="1:18.946" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.709" end="1:17.049">岁月摧残</span><span begin="1:17.049" end="1:17.601">发白</span><span begin="1:17.601" end="1:18.064">就叫我</span><span begin="1:18.064" end="1:18.946">白了头</span></p><p begin="1:18.956" end="1:20.598" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.956" end="1:19.672">铁了心去等</span><span begin="1:19.67